  m_text: "<size=75>Special Thanks</size>\n\n\n<color=#4680ff><b><size=60>Beta Testing</size></b></color>\nCarlos
    \"Gomez Squared\" Gomez-Gomez\nLarry Riggins\nJacob \"Rhya\" N/A\nNethaniel Norris\nKaelib
    Branca\nEli N/A\nMichael Thompson\nEric Fast\n\n\n<color=#55ff55><b><size=60>Inspirations</size></b></color>\nRonald
    \"Mr. Flowe\" Flowers\nDani Dev\nSebastian Lague\nDead Pixel Studios\n\n<color=#888888><size=60><b>Software</color></size></b>\nPhotoshop\nUnity
    Game Engine\nBandLabs\nSoundTrap\nVisual Studio 2023/2024\nMaya 2024\nBlender\nMudBox
    2024\nTextures.com\nGitHub\n\n<size=60><b><color=#555555>External Assets</size></b></color>\nFantasy
    Skyboxes FREE\nXelu Key Prompts\n\n<color=#333333><size=60><b>Investors</color></size></b>\nZinklof.Dev\nGreyson
    Ames\n\n\n<color=#ffff00><size=75><b>And You!</color></b></size>\nMaking games
    is fun and all, but it looses its main point without an amazing community to
    enjoy your work. From all of us here at GearSpin Studios, thank you for playing
    our game! :]\n\n\n\n<b>\nPress\t to exit\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=26>Goblinbane, and
    by extension all [made in house] assets + marketing material is protected under
    US copyright law. GearSpin Studios and Zinklof.Dev reserve all rights when it
    comes to the property made by the companies, for more information visit gearspin.zinklof.dev/copyright.</size>"
